msgstr "Pokretanje usluge nije uspjelo: %1"

#: kcmkded.cpp:126
#, kde-format
msgid "Failed to stop service."
msgstr "Zaustavljanje usluge nije uspjelo."

#: kcmkded.cpp:128
#, kde-format
msgid "Failed to start service."
msgstr "Pokretanje usluge nije uspjelo."

#: kcmkded.cpp:226
#, kde-format
msgid "Failed to notify KDE Service Manager (kded6) of saved changed: %1"
msgstr "Obavještavanje KDE upravitelja usluga (kded6) o spremljenim promjenama nije uspjelo: %1"

#: ui/main.qml:48
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"If you're disabling something here to work around an issue, please <link "
"url='%1'>submit a bug report about it as well.</link>"
msgstr ""
"Ako ovdje nešto onemogućujete kako biste zaobišli problem, molimo <link "
"url='%1'>pošaljite i izvještaj o pogrešci.</link>"

#: ui/main.qml:55
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:status inlinemessage"
msgid ""
"The background services manager (kded6) is currently not running. Make sure "
"it is installed correctly."
msgstr ""
"Upravitelj pozadinskih usluga (kded6) trenutačno ne radi. Provjerite "
"je li ispravno instaliran."

#: ui/main.qml:65
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:status inlinemessage"
msgid ""
"Some services disable themselves again when manually started if they are not "
"useful in the current environment."
msgstr ""
"Neke se usluge same ponovno onemoguće nakon ručnog pokretanja ako nisu "
"korisne u trenutačnom okruženju."

#: ui/main.qml:75
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:status inlinemessage"
msgid ""
"Some services were automatically started/stopped when the background "
"services manager (kded6) was restarted to apply your changes."
msgstr ""
"Neke su usluge automatski pokrenute ili zaustavljene kada je upravitelj "
"pozadinskih usluga (kded6) ponovno pokrenut radi primjene vaših promjena."

